1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,420
He did everything to make his master proud.

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:03,890
He heard it far too late.

3
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:04,260
In a valley

4
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,070
where animals live by kung fu,

5
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,820
masters train at the Jade Palace,

6
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,104
above the village.

7
00:00:09,104 --> 00:00:11,740
Inside waits the Dragon Scroll: limitless power,

8
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:14,193
for one chosen hero, the Dragon Warrior.

9
00:00:14,193 --> 00:00:16,060
Master Shifu, a red panda,

10
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,700
found a snow leopard cub on his steps,

11
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,620
and raised Tai Lung as a son.

12
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,020
He trained him day and night,

13
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,760
sure he was the Dragon Warrior.

14
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,711
Every move was for his father's smile.

15
00:00:24,711 --> 00:00:27,360
But the grand master, Oogway, an ancient tortoise,

16
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,262
saw darkness in him, and refused.

17
00:00:29,493 --> 00:00:31,129
Shifu didn't fight that decision.

18
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:32,700
Tai Lung tore through the valley

19
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:33,550
for the scroll.

20
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,606
Shifu couldn't bring himself to hurt him.

21
00:00:35,606 --> 00:00:36,860
Oogway stopped him.

22
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:37,800
Twenty years in chains,

23
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,110
in a mountain prison, blaming his father.

24
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,960
He escaped, and came home for the scroll,

25
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:42,950
and for an answer.

26
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:44,570
He beat his old master down,

27
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,773
roaring that everything was to make him proud.

28
00:00:46,773 --> 00:00:48,160
And Shifu finally said it:

29
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,560
he'd always been proud.

30
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,010
His pride had blinded him.

31
00:00:51,342 --> 00:00:52,540
Tai Lung didn't stop.

32
00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:54,158
He took the scroll, and opened it.

33
00:00:54,489 --> 00:00:55,300
It was blank.

34
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:57,715
A golden surface, reflecting his own face.

35
00:00:58,146 --> 00:00:59,520
That explains his rage.

36
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,933
It doesn't excuse the harm.

37
00:01:01,164 --> 00:01:02,040
He spent his life trying

38
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,480
to make his father proud.

39
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:04,874
He never had to.
